.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE TRANSITION"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone transition \- Transition a milestone to a target state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone transition [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Transition a milestone to a target state
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.TP
.I TARGET
Target state
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --reason
Why the milestone moved
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
